{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07907","headline":"题长安主人壁 · 孟浩然","name":"题长安主人壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久废南山田，叨陪东阁贤。\n欲随平子去，犹未献甘泉。\n枕籍琴书满，褰帷远岫连。\n我来如昨日，庭树忽鸣蝉。\n促织惊寒女，秋风感长年。\n授衣当九月，无褐竟谁怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}